This is one of the most important features of CHANGE360.

Build a polished poster-creation tool that lets users create personalised awareness posters and impact summaries.

The feature must work on an Android phone.

## Poster types

Include:

### A. Daily Impact Poster
Summarises eligible activities recorded for a selected day.

### B. Weekly Impact Poster
